flowchart TB
    S([Session runs]):::start --> T[Trajectory<br/>user prompts, tool calls, replies, errors]
    T --> L[Failure ledger<br/>fingerprint each failure, count recurrences]:::signal

    T --> R{Auto-refine trigger<br/>compaction  session end  observer signal}:::gate
    R -->|held| S
    R -->|fires| V{{Multi-vote reviewer<br/>3 reviewers  approve if refutations&lt;2<br/>score, bar, strongest-evidence reason}}:::judge

    V -->|reject| S
    V -->|approve| P[Refiner writes edits<br/>prompt note  skill  subagent  factory  memory]
    P --> K[Fix-kind diversity nudge<br/>a note that didn't work twice<br/>becomes a skill or prompt note]:::hint
    K --> P

    P --> Z{Lane?}:::gate
    Z -->|status| ST[Replace in place at kind,path<br/>short session state]:::status
    Z -->|lesson| LE[Harness entry<br/>targets_fingerprints link to failures<br/>durable across sessions]:::lesson
    ST --> H[Harness state]
    LE --> H

    H --> I[Injected into next session's prompt<br/>as memories, skills, subagents, factory specs]
    I --> S

    L --> M{Post-fix recurrence probe<br/>lesson's fingerprint seen again?}:::new
    H --> M
    M -->|no| G[Keep the fix]:::good
    M -->|yes| B[Plan rollback<br/>group hits by originating refinement<br/>reason='recurred']:::warn
    B --> P

    T --> TUL[Tool-use label  side-model<br/>commit-subject style]:::side
    TUL --> UI[TUI chrome rows<br/>recap  tool-use label  session title]
    T --> REC[Away-summary recap  side-model]:::side
    REC --> UI

    R --> MEM[rlm.memory  model-facing tool<br/>7 ops over user-wide personal tree]:::side
    MEM --> H

    classDef start fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#3b6fd4,color:#111,stroke-width:2px
    classDef gate fill:#eef1ff,stroke:#6f73d4,color:#111
    classDef judge fill:#f4ecff,stroke:#8a4bd4,color:#111,stroke-width:2px
    classDef signal fill:#fff1e8,stroke:#d49153,color:#111
    classDef hint fill:#fff8d6,stroke:#c9a700,color:#111
    classDef new fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#c98a00,color:#111,stroke-width:2px
    classDef good fill:#e3f7e8,stroke:#2f9e5b,color:#111
    classDef warn fill:#ffe9d6,stroke:#d9731f,color:#111
    classDef status fill:#eef7ff,stroke:#3b89d4,color:#111
    classDef lesson fill:#edf6ea,stroke:#58a339,color:#111
    classDef side fill:#f7f0f7,stroke:#9e5ba8,color:#111
